	"content_pages": [
		{
			"ref_slug": "oc-how-coaching-works",
			"title": "How coaching works",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How coaching works</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Glad you're here. Here's how the next few months run, so there aren't any surprises.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The rhythm</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"hasFixedLayout\":false} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">The call</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Same time every week</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Notes</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Written up straight after, while it's fresh</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Between calls</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">One or two things to work on</td></tr><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">Your check-in</td><td class=\"has-text-align-left\" data-align=\"left\">A few lines from you the day before</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What I need from you</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tell me when something didn't happen. A week where you did none of it is useful to know about and we can work with it. A week where you say it went fine when it didn't costs us both the next session.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:pullquote -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote\"><blockquote><p>Most of the change happens in the weeks between calls. The sessions are where we work out what to change.</p></blockquote></figure>\n<!-- /wp:pullquote -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Between sessions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send things as they come up rather than saving them for the call. A short answer by message today beats a good one in six days.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rewrite the table to match how you actually run sessions. Weekly is the most common, but fortnightly and monthly work the same way. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "oc-how-coaching-works",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "oc-your-goals",
			"title": "Your goals",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your goals</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Have a go at these before the first session. They shape everything that follows, so it's worth taking your time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What made you decide to do this, and why now?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What does a normal week look like at the moment?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What have you already tried?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you want to get to</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's different in six months if this works?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How will you know you got there? What could you point at?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Which part of that matters most?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What might get in the way</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What's stopped you before?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who or what needs to change for this to be possible?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What aren't you willing to give up?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There aren't any right answers here, and you're allowed to change your mind later.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Build these in your own form tool and paste the embed code or shortcode here, or leave them as they are and work through them in the first session. They're written out so you can rebuild them anywhere. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "oc-your-goals",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "oc-where-you-are",
			"title": "Where you are",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Where you are</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Updated after every session, so you don't have to dig through notes to remember what you said you'd do.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Right now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Building consistency. We're not adding anything new until the current routine holds for three weeks straight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">This week</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Block the two hours on Tuesday and Thursday before anything else gets into the calendar</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>On any day you skip it, write down what happened in one line</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Send the draft over by Friday, finished or not</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Parked for now</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The bigger restructure, and anything involving the new tool. Both worth doing. Neither this month.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rewrite this after every session and keep it short. It works because it holds one focus and a few actions, not because it's complete. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-yellow\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-yellow\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">⚡️ Quick tip</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Put a due date on the module this page sits behind and switch the reminder on. Your client gets a nudge before the session without you writing one, and the date shows on the portal home instead of living in someone's head. <a href=\"https://client-portal.io/support/add-due-dates-and-reminders-434zl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add due dates and reminders</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "oc-where-you-are",
			"meta": []
		},
		{
			"ref_slug": "oc-your-check-in",
			"title": "Your check-in",
			"post_content": "<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your check-in</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Send this the day before we speak. Takes five minutes, and it means we start the session already knowing where to go.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The questions</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What did you actually do this week?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What didn't you get to, and what got in the way?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What went better than you expected?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Out of ten, how's your energy for this right now?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What do you most want out of the next session?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A sentence each is plenty. Nobody's marking it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"callout-blue\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group callout-blue\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Setup note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Build these as a form in whatever you already use and paste the embed code or shortcode here, so answers land in one place and you can look back over them. Delete this note before sharing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->",
			"post_name": "oc-your-check-in",
			"meta": []
		}
	],
